WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.020
Belldandy

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:11.730
Yes?

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:12.580
What is it?

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:16.330
I want you to have this!

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.100
Thank you, Keiichi-san.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.360
It looks great on you.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:41.050
I won't forget you, Keiichi-san...

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:45.820
even if you were to forget about me, I would not forget.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.530
Wh-What're you talking about?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:50.700
I'm sorry.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.500
It was never meant for us to meet.

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:01.170
Destiny had forbidden me from being in this world.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:02.660
I...

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:03.440
obey

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.770
destiny.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:07.770
What's going on?

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:13.650
Didn't you tell me at the beginning that as long as I need you, you'll always be here?

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:15.820
Was that a lie?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.700
I need you!

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:39.840
koi ni naranai ne soba ni iru dake ja

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:39.840
Just being close to you doesn't make love happen.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:47.090
nazo wo kakete mo donkan na hito dakara

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:47.090
Even if I make a puzzle you can't solve it because you're slow

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:54.250
natsu no fuku wo kite haru no umi ni kita

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:54.250
We came to the spring sea, wearing summer clothes.

00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.530
anata no SHATSU de yasashiku kabatte

00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.530
Please cover me gently with your shirt.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.340
My heart iidasenai

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.340
My heart won't let me say

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:08.840
Please KISU shite tte

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:08.840
"Please kiss me."

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:10.170
Day Dream

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:10.170
Day Dream...

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.500
yume wa fukurami

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.500
My dream gets bigger

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.650
sora ni takaku kieru

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.650
and disappears high in the sky.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:27.020
onna no ko wa dare datte shiawase ni nareru

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:27.020
Any girl can be happy.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:33.830
koi ga hajimareba kagayakidasu

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:33.830
When they fall in love, they start shining.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:41.470
tatoe namida nagashite mo anata no sei nara

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:41.470
Even if the tears start flowing, or my heart aches,

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:48.910
mune wo itamete mo yashiku naru

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:48.910
if it's because of you, she'll become gentler

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:07.590
Keiichi-san...

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.550
Did you have a nightmare?

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:16.400
Yeah.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.190
You were...

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:25.850
Never mind!

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:26.900
I'm OK now.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.920
Then I'll get you some water.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.200
OK.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:41.560
Yeah,

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.670
she's a goddess after all.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:49.580
There may well come a day when she'll have to go back to the Heavens.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.350
If that day comes, then...

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:55.590
I'll...

00:03:58.490 --> 00:03:58.750
No.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:03:59.760
That was only a dream.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:12.990
Now you've done it!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.970
Dance, White Spirits...

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.370
Shine, Ice Spirits.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.270
Just as my passionate soul orders you...

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.010
answer with your frozen souls.

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.340
Change your form into that of a white giant,

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:29.600
to guard me and appear before me.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.920
Magnificent strength...

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.550
and a body so manly!

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.840
I shall give thee a name...!

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:38.780
Go!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:39.850
Snowman!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.810
Th-That's...

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.780
You're 12 years and 4 months too young to challenge me to battle!

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:56.170
I'll still get you, in spite of that thing!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.140
Snow-Throwing Machine Phalanx 1.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.740
Target lock!

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:05.500
What the?

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:09.690
Snow?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.120
Good morning.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:12.690
Good morning.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.460
Wow, it's snowed.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.930
It's very unusual to get this much snow at this time of year!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.390
It wasn't that cold yesterday either.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:24.900
Onee-sama!

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.350
Good morning, Skuld.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.100
Keiichi!

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:29.310
Wanna join us?

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:33.210
Look you, are you trying to kill me or something?

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:34.780
I shouldn't be doing this!

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.750
Gotta go put the chains on the sidecar motorcycle.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.200
I wonder if the roads are OK.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:58.550
Just here?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.510
That's strange isn't it?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:04.760
Urd!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.410
You're up to something again, aren't you!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.950
I haven't done anything.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.690
It was all white around here before I knew it.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:15.650
What!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.490
Anyway, we gotta do something about this snow.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.630
It'll be awful if this gets on the news or something!

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:23.030
Keiichi!

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.100
I'll go build a snow-removal machine!

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.810
OK, then, I'll get the snow off the roof.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:36.470
Keiichi-san!

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.050
Please be careful!

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.510
I can handle it!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:58.280
Keiichi-san!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.200
Are you all right?

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:00.990
Yeah.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:01.840
Thanks for saving me.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.440
"I can handle it?" huh!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:04.780
Loser!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.000
But, something weird popped out, and...

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:10.980
Something weird?

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:15.710
It's a Bug!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.240
I won't let you get away!

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:30.370
You've underestimated me!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:52.920
Christmas is now only four days away.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:54.280
That's right.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:08:01.310
Cakes can be seen in store windows all over the city as if Christmas is the only thing on its mind!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.290
Was that the <i>Bug</i>  you were talking about, Skuld?

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:02.500
That's right.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.400
They're not supposed to show up in the surface world unless something very unusual happens up above.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:09.870
What the!

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.740
Now that's amazing!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:17.440
Did you do something to upset Belldandy?

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.410
There wasn't anything unusual about this until I tried to drink it!

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:21.880
This is strange.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.340
Is something wrong?

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:27.820
She's certainly in a good mood.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:29.580
Keiichi-san,

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.660
you'd better eat soon, or you'll be late.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:33.540
OK.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:35.560
Thank you.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.730
Bugs oozing into this side of the world,

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:44.510
does it have anything to do with the fact that you goddesses are here?

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:46.910
It couId be.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:51.970
But I'd have to contact God for details.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.210
Don't move the table without asking!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:02.360
It vanished!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:04.160
Onee-sama.

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:05.200
Could this be...

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:06.170
Yes!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:08.940
Keiichi!

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.830
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:12.500
Don't ask me!

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:14.460
They came sticking to me like magnets!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.010
I knew it, there are still Bugs here!

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:25.470
Skuld's own Debugging Machine.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:28.010
Switch On!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.440
A Bug Exhaust Port!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:50.040
I knew it!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:52.470
A Bug passage has formed in the space between you two!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.450
Get away from each other, you two!

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.520
From the looks of things,

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.750
your close contact is what's causing the Bug Exhaust Port to be formed.

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:05.100
If it's caused by contact between incompatible things

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.650
contact with Urd or myself would have caused it too.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.520
But I've never seen anything like this!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.430
At the very least,

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.990
until we can find the source of this problem Keiichi, don't get near onee-sama, got that?

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.930
There's no telling what other effects there might be!

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:18.390
You can't be serious!

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.080
Belldandy...

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.930
Keiichi-san...

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.420
I'll get it, OK?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:36.310
This is the Morisato residence.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:37.920
It is I.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:38.660
God!

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:44.060
You are aware of all of these strange phenomena, yes?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:44.890
Yes.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:48.460
There's no time to lose.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:53.340
The situation is getting worse with each passing second.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:55.470
Belldandy,

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:58.200
I hereby give you a Recall Notice.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.000
A Recall Notice?

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.800
But I have a contract with Keiichi-san!

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:07.280
I am sure that you, better than anyone, know the reason why.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.850
It'll take three days to set up the Gate.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:11.210
Until then...

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.790
you must not take any careless actions.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:15.930
You can't mean that!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.130
Three days?

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:24.230
Keiichi-san...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.430
What's this Recall Notice?

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:28.770
And, what happens in three days?

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.220
Why?

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.740
Well I don't know why myself.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.510
But you <i>are</i> coming back shortly, right?

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:41.290
No way!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.410
What about the contract we made that day?

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:44.730
What about the promise you made me?

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.650
Was it just some quick-fix?

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:48.480
No!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.960
I made that promise, sincerely!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:55.150
As long as you wish, I'd like to be near you always!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:56.900
But...

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.160
I am a goddess.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.710
I cannot go against God's orders.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:09.320
Perhaps I have been called because of a system malfunction that needs to be fixed.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.190
I'm sorry.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.820
I said too much.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:17.950
Then, in that case, once that problem is solved you can come back, right?

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:19.330
Yes...

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:21.150
I'm sure I can.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.890
Well, then, I'm heading off to school.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:30.120
Sorry I can't give you a lift.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.150
I'm sorry.

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:37.140
If what I think is the cause of this problem...

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:38.750
I...

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:40.220
can no longer...

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:41.850
Keiichi-san!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:55.360
Listen up.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.020
Even on campus, don't go near onee-sama, got it?

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:03.850
'Cause the critical distance in forming a Bug Exhaust Port has a trend toward enlarging!

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:20.720
Hey!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:21.740
Heard the news?

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:24.050
Morisato and Belldandy broke up!

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:25.590
Are you serious?

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:29.750
Then maybe I should go up to her and say hi!

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:32.000
Belldandy.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.420
Eraser, please.

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:41.200
Oh, yeah...

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.260
Belldandy...

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:59.280
You might be better off not going to school for now.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:02.740
end up feeling sorry if you were to go.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:04.910
That's fine.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:07.060
Even if I can't be there by his side,

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.210
I want to be as close to him as I can.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:13.210
I want to breathe the same air.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.140
Get back here right away if the effects start becoming worse, OK?

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:33.680
She seemed really sad.

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.650
She's never gone through anything like this before, you know.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.520
'Cause she's so single-minded.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.490
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:44.560
What <i>are</i>  you doing!?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.540
You're still absent for showing up this late!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.200
Good morning!

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:52.470
It's unusual for you to be here by yourself.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:54.000
Is "you-know-who" absent today?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:54.960
No.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.770
I think she'll be showing up later.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.240
What's wrong with you?

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.110
Did you guys have a fight or something?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.280
It's got nothing to do with you, Sayoko.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:04.850
That's it for today.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:07.120
Papers must be in by the 24th.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.930
Nothing will be accepted after that, so be prepared.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.460
Morisato-kun, I just bought a 500 SL!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:15.980
Wanna go for a ride later on?

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:19.940
Keiichi-san!

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.320
Belldandy!

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:25.830
Keiichi-san!

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:32.210
Are you all right, Morisato-kun?

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:38.520
Since when did they start using such cheap glass at this school?

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.090
Do they have any idea how dangerous it is?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:49.260
Wasn't Belldandy just here?

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:51.500
For me right now...

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.690
it's not possible to do anything for Keiichi-san even if something happens to him.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.080
Can't I...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:02.910
even be allowed to think about Keiichi-san?

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:05.190
Belldandy looking so sad like that.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.220
Dammit!

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:10.610
Isn't there anything I can do for her,

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.410
when she's just about to go back to the Heavens?

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.580
Hey, Kei-chan, did you know?

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:20.860
All over the school, they're talking about you and Belldandy breaking up.

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:24.120
Yeah.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.760
What in the world happened?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.560
Don't tell me that it's for real!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:30.870
Where is Belldandy?

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.830
She's going back in three days, supposedly to her homeland

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.070
Why, all of a sudden?

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.070
Is she coming back soon?

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:44.040
No.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.860
Actually, I don't know for sure.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:53.040
So?

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.100
What're you gonna do about it, Kei-chan?

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:56.850
What am I gonna do about it?

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:58.060
This is something that I can't handle...

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:02.160
I guess a break-up more or less comes down to this.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.640
What's that supposed to mean?

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.230
It's not like we're breaking up!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.670
Then are you gonna follow her overseas,

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.530
Kei-chan?

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:14.710
"Absence makes the heart grow fonder."

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:16.220
You know that's a lie.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:19.000
"Out of sight, out of mind"

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.350
Even so, I wanna believe that love will hold us together.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.180
Wouldn't you?

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:27.990
I'm not going to forget her,

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:29.010
not even for an instant!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:30.760
You Romeo!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:32.490
Kei-chan!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.960
If you love her that much, tell her "stay with me forever!" or something,

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:40.900
and give her a ring that's worth three months of your pay!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.270
On second thought, no guy would do that.

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:44.370
A ring?

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.000
Give her a ring?

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:47.350
A present!

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:54.820
Wait a sec!

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:01.000
I'm supposed to clean that up?

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.140
Senpai!

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:05.750
Please fix me up with a part-time job!

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:07.930
I don't care what it is!

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:09.720
I just need the money badly!

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.050
All right! Gotcha!

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.680
Come with me, starting tomorrow!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.180
Senpai,

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:21.540
they're hiring at a convenience store near my house.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:22.670
I'll take that too.

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:28.280
But, senpai, why do you need to earn money so fast?

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:30.090
Senpai!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.280
Don't tell me that you made Belldandy-senpai...

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:33.980
pre-pre-pre-pregn-

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:34.650
pre-pre-pre-pregn-

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:35.180
pre-pre-pre-pregn-

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:35.750
pre-pre-pre-pregn-

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:37.160
That's not it!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.560
Well senpai, I'll take on your offer starting tomorrow.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.360
Come prepared with all your energy! Got that?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:46.400
Hasegawa, let me know later who I have to talk to for that store job.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:51.140
Hasegawa,

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:54.680
if you see Belldandy, could you give her this?

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:57.200
This?

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.640
But, senpai, wouldn't it be better if you do it...

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:01.580
No.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:02.430
It's OK.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:03.100
Could you do it for me?

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.770
I don't mind, but...

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.320
Senpai!

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:19.570
Senpai,

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.750
Morisato-senpai asked me to give this to you.

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:24.960
Keiichi-san did?

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:29.570
I don't know what happened between you two, senpai...

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.170
but please cheer up, OK?

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.380
That's all I can say.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.830
That's all I can say.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.640
Thank you, Hasegawa-san.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:40.880
Well, then...

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:48.530
Belldandy...

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:52.130
let's go back home separately just like how we came to school today.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:55.770
I was glad to see your face if only for a moment.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.220
Keiichi.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:17.600
Well?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.190
Have you figured out anything?

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:24.600
The fact that Bugs are gathering in this world via an Exhaust Port

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:27.560
has gotta mean that there's an Attractor somewhere.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:33.900
I don't know why a Port would form in the space between Keiichi and onee-sama,

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:40.140
but the point of concentration must be the Exhaust Port's energy source!

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:41.830
If we can destroy that...

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.150
Then there'd be no more Bugs coming out, right?

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:47.890
First we have to find the Attractor, and then seal the Port!

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:17.850
What're you doing?

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:18.780
Oh, nothing!

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.900
The mirror was dirty, so...

00:22:27.930 --> 00:22:30.790
Anyway, I heard that you broke up with Morisato-kun.

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:36.300
I'm always thinking about Keiichi-san.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:38.930
Oh, really?

00:22:39.570 --> 00:22:41.510
Then, the other rumor wasn't true either.

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:45.470
The rumor that you're going back to your homeland.

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:48.410
Actually, that's...

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:49.850
No way!

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:52.150
You're not seriously going back, are you?

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:54.570
I will not let you just take your winnings and run!

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:57.920
You arrived out of the blue, became "Miss Popularity,"

00:22:58.560 --> 00:22:59.990
and now it's goodbye?

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:02.030
You <i>are</i>  coming back soon, aren't you?

00:23:04.280 --> 00:23:05.490
That I can't say...

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:07.700
Really?

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:13.670
I suggest that you get back as soon as possible.

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:17.880
I may just steal Morisato-kun away from you.

00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:02.450
What is it?

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:03.340
Onee-sama!

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:07.300
We've figured out what's attracting the Bugs to this world!

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:12.970
It's because this tree's got some powerful energy sealed in it!

00:24:36.410 --> 00:24:37.460
Oh, God!

00:24:40.380 --> 00:24:40.940
What is it?

00:24:41.580 --> 00:24:43.340
Do you know something about this tree?

00:24:47.910 --> 00:24:48.530
Belldandy!

00:24:49.170 --> 00:24:50.930
If you know something, tell us!

00:24:51.570 --> 00:24:55.140
If we can take care of this, we might be able to live the way we were, right?

00:24:57.580 --> 00:24:58.310
Not this.

00:24:58.950 --> 00:25:01.110
I can't do anything about this!

00:25:02.320 --> 00:25:03.180
Why?

00:25:03.820 --> 00:25:08.690
Then, after you've gone back to the Heavens, I can never get close to you ever again?

00:25:09.330 --> 00:25:11.360
I can never be allowed to see you again for the rest of my life?

00:25:12.000 --> 00:25:12.660
I'm sorry...

00:25:13.960 --> 00:25:14.530
You gotta be kidding me!

00:25:15.170 --> 00:25:18.380
I won't understand anything, if you just keep apologizing like that!

00:25:19.720 --> 00:25:20.530
Even just a minute,

00:25:21.170 --> 00:25:22.530
or even just a second longer.

00:25:23.170 --> 00:25:24.460
I wanna be with you, Belldandy!

00:25:30.080 --> 00:25:31.250
So do I.

00:25:31.890 --> 00:25:33.250
So do I!

00:25:35.090 --> 00:25:35.380
But I can't say it!

00:25:35.880 --> 00:25:37.550
But I can't say it!

00:25:37.550 --> 00:25:37.890
But I can't say it!

00:25:49.930 --> 00:25:51.160
Can't I...

00:25:51.800 --> 00:25:52.160
keep the promise that we made

00:25:53.310 --> 00:25:54.800
forever?

00:25:56.460 --> 00:25:58.540
It's all my fault.

00:25:59.720 --> 00:26:01.410
But God,

00:26:02.050 --> 00:26:02.460
grant my wish...

00:26:04.130 --> 00:26:05.460
just this one wish

00:26:06.560 --> 00:26:08.200
please make it come true!

00:26:11.460 --> 00:26:15.350
I beg you!

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:52.760
ude wo kunda hishochi no sanpo de

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:52.760
Taking a stroll at a summer resort, arm in arm,

00:26:52.980 --> 00:26:58.270
guuzen deau CHAPERU no wedding

00:26:52.980 --> 00:26:58.270
we happened to come across a wedding at a chapel.

00:26:58.490 --> 00:27:03.740
asa no kaze ni tokekomu sanbika

00:26:58.490 --> 00:27:03.740
Gospels melting in the morning breeze...

00:27:03.960 --> 00:27:08.680
shiawase sou na futari

00:27:03.960 --> 00:27:08.680
A happy looking couple...

00:27:09.300 --> 00:27:11.710
omedetou! omedetou

00:27:09.300 --> 00:27:11.550
"Congratulations!"

00:27:11.770 --> 00:27:14.450
"Thank you!"

00:27:11.910 --> 00:27:14.450
arigatou! arigatou

00:27:14.670 --> 00:27:20.200
shiroi BU-KE wo sashidasu shinpu

00:27:14.670 --> 00:27:20.150
The bride tosses her white bouquet.

00:27:20.370 --> 00:27:26.790
shiawase shiawase 
 wakete ageru

00:27:20.370 --> 00:27:26.790
I will share my happiness with you.

00:27:27.010 --> 00:27:31.730
tonari de hohoemu kare

00:27:27.010 --> 00:27:31.730
The groom smiling next to her.

00:27:31.950 --> 00:27:37.000
futari noseta kuruma ga ugoku to

00:27:31.950 --> 00:27:37.000
When the car carrying the couple starts to move,

00:27:37.220 --> 00:27:42.640
anata ooki na akubi hitotsu

00:27:37.220 --> 00:27:42.640
you let out a big yawn.

00:27:42.860 --> 00:27:48.120
GYUTto ude wo tsunette ageta no

00:27:42.860 --> 00:27:48.120
I pinch your arm...

00:27:48.340 --> 00:27:54.350
omoi ni kidzuku kashira

00:27:48.340 --> 00:27:54.350
I wonder if you even realize how I feel?

00:28:08.100 --> 00:28:08.250
The past,

00:28:08.890 --> 00:28:10.130
the mistake that she made.

00:28:11.380 --> 00:28:12.930
the fear of a tomorrow without light.

00:28:13.570 --> 00:28:13.930
The present,

00:28:14.570 --> 00:28:16.730
this moment is my everything.

00:28:17.370 --> 00:28:19.350
I don't want the goddess qualification!

00:28:19.990 --> 00:28:20.280
Oh, God...

00:28:20.920 --> 00:28:23.430
I never wanted to be born a goddess!
